  "description": "<p data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"529\">Stap in de wereld van het populaire survivalprogramma <strong data-start=\"312\" data-end=\"325\">Koh-Lanta</strong> (de Franse versie van <em data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"368\">Expeditie Robinson</em>) en neem het op tegen andere kandidaten in fysieke proeven, puzzels en overlevingstaken. Verzamel middelen, win immuniteit en blijf zolang mogelijk in het spel!</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"531\" data-end=\"653\">Dit exemplaar verkeert <strong data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"572\">In Nette Staat</strong>, volledig getest en 100% functioneel.<br data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"613\">Wordt <strong data-start=\"619\" data-end=\"652\">standaard met doosje geleverd</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"672\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<li data-start=\"673\" data-end=\"723\">\r\n<p data-start=\"675\" data-end=\"723\">🏝️ Gebaseerd op het bekende survivalprogramma</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"779\">\r\n<p data-start=\"726\" data-end=\"779\">🧩 Mix van fysieke uitdagingen, puzzels en survival</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"815\">\r\n<p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"815\">👥 Speel solo of in multiplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"870\">\r\n<p data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"870\">🎮 Geschikt voor fans van Robinson-achtige spellen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"933\">\r\n<p data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"933\">🔄 Afwisselende gameplay met verschillende soorten proeven</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"935\" data-end=\"938\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"962\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<li data-start=\"963\" data-end=\"987\">\r\n<p data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"987\"><strong data-start=\"965\" data-end=\"975\">Titel:</strong> Koh-Lanta</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"988\" data-end=\"1021\">\r\n<p data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1021\"><strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1003\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo Switch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1022\" data-end=\"1051\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1051\"><strong data-start=\"1024\" data-end=\"1034\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1094\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1094\"><strong data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1064\">Genre:</strong> Avontuur / Survival / Party</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1122\"><strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1109\">Spelers:</strong> 1–4 lokaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1151\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1151\"><strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1138\">Geleverd:</strong> Met doosje</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1156\">\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1158\" data-end=\"1191\"><strong data-start=\"1162\" data-end=\"1181\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
